SLEARN v2.00
September 20, 1992


This archive contains the shareware version of SLEARN (the SALT Learn
utility) version 2.00, an automatic script writer for use with the
Telix telecommunications program.  For further details, system
requirements and instructions, please see SLEARN.DOC.


In the meantime, suffice to say that if you're using Telix, SLEARN
can make your life MUCH easier!  Here are some comments from
registered users:


  "I've been trying to tweak a script for a local BBS for weeks.  The
   first time I used SLEARN it created a flawless script for me!"

  "I register SLEARN with the greatest of enthusiasm...  makes things so
   simple and quick."

  "Great program - makes a tedious task a breeze."

  "I was VERY impressed when I first used SLEARN, so easy and automatic,
   and the scripts worked flawlessly."

  "SLEARN has been a lifesaver for a newborn to Telix."

  "Just fantastic!"

  "This program is an inspired idea!"


And that was the OLD version!

